Title:
Implementation of work package tasks No. 2 (WP2) in the field of education, namely:
- teaching activities for higher education institutions - teaching the courses "EU Digital Transformation Policy" and Information Security in the EU and Ukraine: legal and political aspect" (32 academic hours each);
- seminars and training events for schools - conducting a training for teachers "European experience for the Ukrainian school" on the topic: "Digital literacy. How to protect schoolchildren from disinformation?" (4 academic hours in total).
Implementation of work package tasks No. 3 (WP 3) in the field of education, namely:
- preparation of a section of a collective monograph.
Implementation of work package tasks No. 4 (WP 4) in the field of education, namely:
- popularization of the project for a wide audience - creation of promotional materials, use of various communication channels and dissemination of information about the project to raise awareness about it;
- conducting project activities - organization and conduct of project activities, including promotional ones in order to attract stakeholders, disseminate project results, exchange knowledge, promote discussions and opportunities for cooperation and networking.
Implementation of work package tasks No. 5 (WP 5) in the field of education, namely:
- general project management - participation in regular meetings of the project team on its implementation;
- contractual framework for project implementation - development and implementation of the project's contractual framework, which outlines the legal and procedural aspects of the project (conclusion of relevant contracts with V. N. Karazin Kharkiv National University);
- reporting - regular reporting activities, including the preparation and submission of reports on the work performed;
- project quality monitoring - regular evaluation and feedback during project implementation.
